== Remark 6.2': unclipped cover route exponents ==
  L>=3: theta < 1/(2(2L+1)) = 1/(2*(2*Lv + 1)) = 1/(4L+2)
  L=2: entropy ~ K^2 a^-4 = K^4, deviation K * K^2/sqrt(n) -> theta < 1/6
== Lemma 7.2 constants ==
  2*(3/2)^3/3 = 9/4  = 9/4
  ln(2M) with M=2^d: (d + 1)*log(2) = (d+1) ln 2
== Lemma 7.1(d): (1-1/M)^(M-1) >= 1/e numerically for M=2..1e6 ==
  min over M in {2,..}:  1.000000499971536
